#71500
"Below Hark's Finger"
"The small trail leads directly to the base of the steep rock formation known

as Hark's Finger.  To your south you see a patch of total destruction,

completely out of place with the rest of the forest.  Trees have been scarred,

branches smashed, plants trampled and some even appear to be burnt.  The trail

begins its ascent to the north.

"
