"This portion of the cave seems to be set aside for dining.  A large oak table,

covered with grease, has half a dozen food-encrusted salvers littering its

surface.  Eight small tree trunks encircle the table, bits of food and bones

stuck to their surface.  The light of a firepit to the east keeps this area

well-lit.

"
