#71531
"Storeroom"
"This small chamber is a storeroom for all sorts of things.  Against one wall

you can see a large pile of furs, against another is a stack of bones about

two feet high.  Against the northern wall is a heap of rocks; why they need to

be stored underground is hard to imagine.  The southern wall is bare save for

a single, broken bow.  The stone beneath your feet seems strangely fragile.  A

trapdoor is in the roof.

"
""
