#71532
"Abandoned Cave"
"This large cave is dark and dank.  It smells of mildew and mold, and appears

to be in disuse.  The rock is slightly scraped at your feet, evidence that

this has been used in aeons past.  The cave looms open to the north, west, and

east; to your south the rock is cold and hard.

