#71533
"Abandoned Cave"
"This small northern niche, like the rest of this area, is made of

mildew-covered dark rock.  The walls are damp to the touch, though no actual

source of water is apparent.  Aged bits of straw are scattered about on the

ground, and a few bits of disintegrating cloth add a small splash of color to

the area.

"
