#71534
"Abandoned Cave"
"This eastern nook of the cave has a low, jagged ceiling.  Rough edges of rock

hang down, ready to snag the hair of an unsuspecting giant.  A shallow

indentation has been carved out of the wall, similar to one which is often

used for sacrifice.

