#71535
"Abandoned Cave"
"To the east the cave opens up into a larger area; here you are quite cramped

and the air is old and stale.  If you are very still, you can imagine yourself

hearing the sounds of the great Vaasa; chirps of birds are almost audible. 

The wall, when touched, seems to vibrate, though you can see no source of the

motion.

"
